  m_Name: Apathetic
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: Class goes on, and so do the notes. Compliments, bad jokes, a doodle of
      a soccer ball with a tiny heart on it. They pile up on the corner of your desk.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: You do not even glance at them. You have heard the lines before, and they
      never really landed. Mostly they are just noise between you and the lesson.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
    text: Hey, are you even listening to me?
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: ...Sorry, what?
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: You are not being cold on purpose. You simply were not paying attention,
      and that is what bothers him more than a rejection ever could.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: Over the next few days Archer tries everything. A drink waiting at your
      desk. A saved seat at lunch. Showing up at the garden "by coincidence".
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: Each time you thank him politely and go right back to whatever you were
      doing.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: 'He keeps waiting for something: a blush, an eye roll, a single flustered
      word. Nothing ever comes.'
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: 450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: afa34e88127769646b20f600dc2d0b41, type: 2}
    text: Hey, {playerName}. Can I ask you something honest?
